  "type": "Click",
  "display_name": "Ripper",
  "display_fullname": "Scrapper Melee Quills Ripper",
  "display_help": "You can unleash a spectacular slashing maneuver that attacks all villains in a wide arc in front of you. Ripper deals massive damage and poisons multiple targets. It can even knock foes down. <br><br>Ripper will also cause much more toxic damage based on the amount of poison coursing through your opponent. You will gain a highlight ring when attacking a target with maximum poison.<br><br>Spine poison deals additional Toxic damage and Slows affected foes. The more the poison stacks, the stonger it becomes. Ripper inflicts poison at twice the rate of other powers.<br><br>",
